<title>UK: SOCCER-DERBY SIGN SECOND ITALIAN.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DERBY SIGN SECOND ITALIAN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian striker Francesco Baiano signed for  Derby County on Friday in a 1.5 million pounds ($2.5 million) deal  with Fiorentina.</p>
<p>Baiano agreed a three-year contract and became the second Italian  to join Derby in the close season. Midfielder Stefano Eranio moved  to the English premier league club from AC Milan earlier.</p>
